    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I view math as a practical tool for problem-solving, especially in economics and chemistry. While I don't love it as much as literature or physics, I appreciate its structure and how it helps me analyze real-world scenarios. I find it challenging but useful for my studies and future career.",
